From c7a7b84320e7cc65970191632c983907218f224f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:53:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-blk: try one worker hint for a burst of direct reads

Gate the private experiment on a direct block backing and locally staged work. Charge a single per-engine token after an aligned initial read is accepted and return it on its CQE. Leave submit retries, continuations, writes and flush barriers in their normal paths.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
